---
description: Run only the XCTest unit tests related to the requested screen or flow on the physical iPhone
argument-hint: <screen, flow, behavior, or XCTest identifier>
allowed-tools: Bash, Glob, Grep, Read
---

Interpret `$ARGUMENTS` as the current test scope. Do not reuse an unrelated
scope from earlier conversation and do not run the full suite unless the user
explicitly requests it. The Python launcher indexes test sources and resolves
the narrowest confident suite or method. If it reports no match or ambiguity,
inspect the suggested test sources and report the gap instead of substituting
unrelated tests.

Run the shared launcher:

```bash
"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT:-$HOME/.local}/bin/fastUnitTest" "$ARGUMENTS"
```

Use `--hot` only when no build input changed after the cached build. Report the
selected identifier, whether the build was skipped, and the test result.
